    the skin tear was evaluated on 2026-02-25.
    the order for the gauze pads is dated 2026-02-20.
    the order for the gauze pads is signed by the treating practitioner.
    the order for the gauze pads includes beneficiary name.
    the order for the gauze pads includes order date.
    the order for the gauze pads includes description of the item.
    the order for the gauze pads includes quantity to be dispensed.
    the order for the gauze pads includes treating practitioner name.
    the order for the gauze pads was communicated to the supplier on 2026-02-22.
    the gauze pads was delivered on 2026-03-01.
    the supplier holds proof of delivery for the gauze pads.
    pay expects answers [].
    rn expects answers ["claim 1 is reasonable and necessary"].
    stage expects answers ["the query fails at remedy"].

